**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
.git
.venv

# Env files at any depth: apps/web/.env.local holds a developer's secrets, and `next start` would
# load it in production, filling in any variable a deployment forgot to set.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# Tests, CI and editor files: not needed to build or run the image.
.github
e2e
playwright-report
test-results
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Local working notes and agent files (see .gitignore), which must never ship in an image.
/note.md
/claude.md
/CLAUDE.md
/report.md
/apps/web/AGENTS.md
/apps/web/CLAUDE.md
